    "caption": "Average Weekly News Hours by Survey Date, shown to answer trend of weekly news consumption hours across survey waves over time. An international media observatory and comparative research network conducted periodic population-weighted survey waves between January 2021 and December 2024 across five countries. The research tracks shifting reliance on digital channels versus traditional broadcasting, audience trust in primary information sources, and weekly engagement intensity."
